      "mergeID": "66bca045df5c72979071cedf",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Latest open beta has a regression where it is not longer possible to move or rotate while menu is open.\n\nRotating while the menu is open is particularly useful to select a player's capsule while they're moving around. This behavior should be reverted back to before the latest open beta.",
